---
// Landing page — warm, human, personal
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Liad Levy — Electrical Engineering student, homelab builder, dad of two. Personal hub." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <title>Liad Levy</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>

  <header class="hub-header">PERSONAL HUB</header>

  <main class="landing">
    <div class="content">

      <div class="intro">
        <span class="hello">About me —</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="name">Liad<br>Levy</h1>

      <p class="tagline">Electrical Engineering Student (RF Track) · Israel</p>

      <div class="bio">
        <p>Hey there! I'm an Electrical Engineering student and a lifelong tinkerer. For as long as I can remember, I've been obsessed with figuring out how things work and solving problems using technology.</p>
        <p>The real turning point happened when I rescued an old PC from the street. It was the perfect playground I needed to unleash that curiosity.</p>
        <p>In today's AI era, everything clicked. Instead of spending months mastering every single domain from scratch, I leverage AI to instantly bridge the gap for any task at hand. It has become my ultimate force multiplier — allowing me to jump straight into action, write custom code, and deploy complex tools one late-night session at a time.</p>
        <p>In fact, it's exactly how I built this entire personal hub, mapped out my homelab blueprints, and developed the web application you can access right here on this site.</p>
        <p class="bio-footer">Dad of two. Permanently curious. Learning by doing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="/homelab" class="cta-primary">
          Homelab <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/second-brain" class="cta-brain">
          Second Brain <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/LiadLevy92" class="cta-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/liadlevy92/" class="cta-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      liad-dev.com
    </footer>
  </main>

</body>
</html>

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  body {
    background: #0e0f18;
    color: #e8eaf2;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* Subtle warm glow in the center */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(255, 181, 71, 0.055), transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 20% 80%, rgba(120, 100, 200, 0.04), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .landing {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 64px 10vw;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hub-header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 28px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #3a3f58;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    z-index: 10;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hello {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #ffb547;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: clamp(64px, 11vw, 128px);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -3px;
    line-height: 0.92;
    color: #f0f1f8;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #6b7280;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .bio {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #9ba3b5;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .bio-footer {
    color: #6b7280;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #0e0f18;
    background: #ffb547;
    padding: 13px 28px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .cta-primary:hover {
    background: #ffc872;
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .cta-primary .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-primary:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .cta-brain {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #fff;
    background: #6366f1;
    padding: 13px 28px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .cta-brain:hover {
    background: #818cf8;
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .cta-brain .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-brain:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .cta-secondary {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #6b7280;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2d3e;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-secondary:hover {
    color: #e8eaf2;
    border-color: #6b7280;
  }

  .footer {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 28px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #2e3348;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .landing { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .name { letter-spacing: -2px; }
  }
</style>
